{"id":"H2332","lemma":"חַוָּה","transliteration":"chavvah","sayIt":"chav-VAH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Eve","meaning":"A woman living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Gen.3.20;\nmarried to Adam (H0121);\nmother of: Cain (H7014B), Abel (H1893) and Seth (H8352)\nAlso named: Eua (Εὖα \"Eve\" G2096)\n§ Eve = \"life\" or \"living\"\nthe first woman, wife of Adam","glosses":["eve"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-3","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eve","kjv":"Eve"}},{"chapterId":"gen-4","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eve","kjv":"Eve"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 3:20","note":"The man called his wife Eve because she would be the mother of all the living.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0121","lemma":"אָדָם","transliteration":"adam","gloss":"Adam"},{"id":"H1893","lemma":"הֶ֫בֶל","transliteration":"hevel","gloss":"Abel"},{"id":"H7014","lemma":"קַ֫יִן","transliteration":"qayin","gloss":"Kain"},{"id":"H8352","lemma":"שֵׁת","transliteration":"shet","gloss":"Seth"},{"id":"G2096","lemma":"Εὖα","transliteration":"eua","gloss":"Eve"},{"id":"H0120","lemma":"אָדָם","transliteration":"adam","gloss":"man"},{"id":"H8351","lemma":"שֵׁת","transliteration":"shet","gloss":"Sheth"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}